  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "20342157",
      "title": "Finishing the REST Routes",
      "lectureOrder": 509,
      "videoOrder": 451,
      "sourceHash": "15653902fa9385d5d9890511d6cc5522c93c6050cd84e370faa7922a6c22182d",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.07,
          "end": 3.83,
          "en": "So there are two more routes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.83,
          "end": 5.57,
          "en": "which I want to register here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 5.57,
          "end": 7.28,
          "en": "and the first extra route",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 7.28,
          "end": 10.113,
          "en": "is a put route to /todo/:todoid.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 15.76,
          "end": 19.17,
          "en": "The idea is that requests reaching this route",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 19.17,
          "end": 20.853,
          "en": "simply replace a todo.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 21.72,
          "end": 24.47,
          "en": "So here we also get our three arguments",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 24.47,
          "end": 27.11,
          "en": "but now in here I wanna override that todo.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 27.11,
          "end": 29.817,
          "en": "A todo, which I identify by this todoId.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 30.66,
          "end": 34.73,
          "en": "So the tid for todoId",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 34.73,
          "end": 35.79,
          "en": "can be extracted from",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 35.79,
          "end": 40.347,
          "en": "req.params and then they're simply",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 40.347,
          "end": 44.03,
          "en": ".todoId, which is available because",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 44.03,
          "end": 45.89,
          "en": "we got this here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 45.89,
          "end": 49.49,
          "en": "And with that, I want to find the index",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 49.49,
          "end": 52.11,
          "en": "of that todo in my todos array",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 53.2,
          "end": 56.35,
          "en": "so we get our todoIndex here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 56.35,
          "end": 57.97,
          "en": "We're reaching out to todos,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 57.97,
          "end": 59.88,
          "en": "and there we can call findIndex",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 59.88,
          "end": 62.06,
          "en": "to find the index of some element",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 62.06,
          "end": 64.33,
          "en": "and this takes a function which executes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 64.33,
          "end": 69.18,
          "en": "on every array item, so on every todo item therefore.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 69.18,
          "end": 71.73,
          "en": "I want to return true if the todoItem",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 71.73,
          "end": 74.36,
          "en": "I'm currently looking at has an id",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 74.36,
          "end": 76.73,
          "en": "that's equal to my extracted tid here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 76.73,
          "end": 79.023,
          "en": "so to this todoId I extracted from the URL.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 80.17,
          "end": 82.43,
          "en": "That will give me the todoIndex",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 82.43,
          "end": 84.86,
          "en": "of the todo I want to update.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 84.86,
          "end": 89.86,
          "en": "I'll now check if todoIndex is greater or equal than zero,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 90.25,
          "end": 92.87,
          "en": "otherwise we didn't find a valid index,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 92.87,
          "end": 94.67,
          "en": "and if it is I want to continue,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 94.67,
          "end": 98.95,
          "en": "otherwise, I will return a response",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 98.95,
          "end": 101.56,
          "en": "where I set the status code to 404",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 101.56,
          "end": 103.00999999999999,
          "en": "because we weren't able to find",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 103.00999999999999,
          "end": 106.24000000000001,
          "en": "a todo with that index, and I sent back a message",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 106.24000000000001,
          "end": 111.24000000000001,
          "en": "where I say \"Could not find todo for this id\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 112.14,
          "end": 114.28,
          "en": "or whatever you want to return.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 114.28,
          "end": 115.56,
          "en": "In this if block however,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 115.56,
          "end": 118.49000000000001,
          "en": "we know that have a valid todo.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 118.49000000000001,
          "end": 122.05,
          "en": "So here I want to reach out to my todos",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 122.05,
          "end": 125.447,
          "en": "for that todoIndex and replace the todos",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 125.447,
          "end": 128.12,
          "en": "stored there with a new object.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 128.12,
          "end": 130.29,
          "en": "Now again, here are types of complaints",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 130.29,
          "end": 132.77,
          "en": "if I just would keep the code as it is",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 132.77,
          "end": 136.42000000000002,
          "en": "because an empty object is not a valid todo",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 136.42000000000002,
          "end": 139.78,
          "en": "and that's great, that's exactly the support we want.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 139.78,
          "end": 144.78,
          "en": "So here we can now set the id to either a brand new id",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 145.38,
          "end": 148.41,
          "en": "or we keep the existing todo's id",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 148.41,
          "end": 150.27,
          "en": "to just update the text.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 150.27,
          "end": 151.84,
          "en": "That's what I'm going to do",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 151.84,
          "end": 154.01,
          "en": "by reaching out to the existing todo",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 154.01,
          "end": 156.16,
          "en": "and then there, I'll just get the id",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 156.16,
          "end": 160.18,
          "en": "and keep that id and just update the text",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 160.18,
          "end": 161.77,
          "en": "to the request body text,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 161.77,
          "end": 163.893,
          "en": "which I now got on the incoming request.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 165.05,
          "end": 166.55,
          "en": "With that, we updated the todo",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 167.4,
          "end": 170.933,
          "en": "and then I wanna return response status 200",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 173.3,
          "end": 175.93,
          "en": "and also reply with a message",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 175.93,
          "end": 178.23,
          "en": "where I say \"Updated todo\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 178.23,
          "end": 181.8,
          "en": "and maybe I'll return all my todos here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 181.8,
          "end": 183.97,
          "en": "Side note, I forgot to return",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 183.97,
          "end": 186.22,
          "en": "a response here in the post request.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 186.22,
          "end": 188.14,
          "en": "Of course I want to do that here as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 188.14,
          "end": 191.07,
          "en": "Set the status code to 201 to confirm",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 191.07,
          "end": 192.97,
          "en": "that something was inserted",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 192.97,
          "end": 196.047,
          "en": "and then maybe a message of \"Added todo.\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 199.57999999999998,
          "end": 202.04,
          "en": "Return the new todo which we did add",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 202.04,
          "end": 203.85,
          "en": "and maybe even return the overall",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 203.85,
          "end": 205.55,
          "en": "todos array if we want to.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 205.55,
          "end": 207.01,
          "en": "Of course, it's up to you which kind",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 207.01,
          "end": 208.443,
          "en": "of data you want to return.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 209.68,
          "end": 212.24,
          "en": "Side note, you need to add the return keyword",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 212.24,
          "end": 214.64,
          "en": "in front of this response here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 214.64,
          "end": 218.37,
          "en": "to avoid that this response and code runs as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 218.37,
          "end": 220.86,
          "en": "We only want to send back one response",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 220.86,
          "end": 222.52,
          "en": "and therefore we need to return",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 222.52,
          "end": 225.4,
          "en": "to avoid that this code executes as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 225.4,
          "end": 227.94,
          "en": "And with that, we added the put route.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 227.94,
          "end": 230.56,
          "en": "Now it's time for the delete route.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 230.56,
          "end": 233.34,
          "en": "So on the router, we can register a delete route,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 233.34,
          "end": 238.07,
          "en": "maybe for /todo/:todoId, so similar to the put route,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 238.07,
          "end": 239.623,
          "en": "just with a different word.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 240.66,
          "end": 244.11,
          "en": "There we also get the request,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 244.11,
          "end": 246.583,
          "en": "response, and this next function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 247.59,
          "end": 249.53,
          "en": "Then in here, we of course want",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 249.53,
          "end": 252.77,
          "en": "to update the todos to get rid of one.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 252.77,
          "end": 254.67,
          "en": "For that, I'll convert my todos array",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 254.67,
          "end": 257.92,
          "en": "from a const to a variable with the let keyword",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 257.92,
          "end": 261.13,
          "en": "to ensure that we actually can override it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 261.13,
          "end": 263.18,
          "en": "with a brand new array because I want",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 263.18,
          "end": 266.53,
          "en": "to get rid of a todo by creating a new array",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 266.53,
          "end": 269.693,
          "en": "which is the old array minus the deleted array.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 271.11,
          "end": 273.32,
          "en": "For that, we can simply set todos",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 273.32,
          "end": 277.493,
          "en": "equal to todos.filter to filter out a todo.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 278.79,
          "end": 281.40999999999997,
          "en": "For that, it runs a function on every todo",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 281.40999999999997,
          "end": 285.22,
          "en": "and if we return true in that function, we keep the todo.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 285.22,
          "end": 287.713,
          "en": "If we return false, we delete it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 288.868,
          "end": 293.868,
          "en": "I want to return false if the todoItem.id",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 294.06,
          "end": 298.133,
          "en": "is not equal to the request params todoId",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 300.13,
          "end": 302.24,
          "en": "because if this is equal, I know it's the todo",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 302.24,
          "end": 305.43,
          "en": "I wanna delete so I want to return false",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 305.43,
          "end": 308.14,
          "en": "for that match, hence this exclamation mark here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 308.14,
          "end": 310.19,
          "en": "to make sure that the new todos array",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 310.19,
          "end": 313.563,
          "en": "does not contain the todo with this todoId here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 315.6,
          "end": 316.59,
          "en": "And that's all.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 316.59,
          "end": 318.95,
          "en": "Now we can send back a response",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 321.01,
          "end": 324.66,
          "en": "where we say \"Deleted todo\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 324.66,
          "end": 325.96,
          "en": "and maybe if you want to,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 325.96,
          "end": 327.663,
          "en": "return the entire array of todos.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 328.58,
          "end": 330.37,
          "en": "So that's a very simple REST API",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 330.37,
          "end": 332.53,
          "en": "with four routes which allow us to",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 332.53,
          "end": 337.483,
          "en": "get, create, update, and delete our todos.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 338.67,
          "end": 340.62,
          "en": "Now, let's also test this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 340.62,
          "end": 342.5,
          "en": "and see whether everything works",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 342.5,
          "end": 344.53,
          "en": "before we then work a little bit more",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 344.53,
          "end": 347.71,
          "en": "on the project structure and how we split our code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 347.71,
          "end": 349.13,
          "en": "and before I also share",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 349.13,
          "end": 351.13,
          "en": "some other information about TypeScript.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}
